    : `Hi,\r\n\r\nYour procurement analysis is attached: the Analytics Dashboard, the Technical Approval Form and the Procurement Analysis Report${audio ? ', plus a short audio summary' : ''}, covering ${quoteFiles.length} supplier quotation(s).\r\n\r\nNothing has been sent to any supplier yet. When you're ready, click below to notify them:\r\n${approveLink}\r\n\r\n— AI Procurement Copilot (automated)`;

